# Sinkmarket Floor's bonded cellar (CIPlay sinkmarket_floor_caves, 11-11 w06; in a test world 'CI ...'). Points as in
# the recipe (30 m down): the mouth in its own mound at 9 -9, the bore running yaw 135 for 14 m, the cellar round
# 26.7 -26.7 (air zone sm_bondedcellar, the bonded goods at 28.2 -28.2). Heights are guesses.
island Sinkmarket Floor keep
offset 0 0
hour 11
weather Calm

picture sm_cave_out 4 4 -4 11 2 -11
walk 6.2 -6.2 to 9 -9 to 13 -13 to 18.9 -18.9 to 23 -23 to 26.7 -26.7 below=-2
air sm_bondedcellar here
picture sm_cave_in 15 3 -15 27 2 -27 light=20
picture sm_room_back 31 3 -31 19 2 -19 light=20
open Bonded goods
wait 2
expect item Glass 2
air sm_bondedcellar
walk 26.7 -26.7 to 23 -23 to 18.9 -18.9 to 13 -13 to 9 -9 to 6.2 -6.2 below=-2
